Cell["\<\
The table below lists the following columns: A Row length, the fractional \
number of rows to make a perfect square, and then a list consisting of {the \
rounded number of rows, the resulting particle count, the box ratio, the \
column/row ratio}.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993112532292149*^9, 
  3.9931127620603456`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ec53b792-ecc2-4e23-b4ad-\
1d4e08725858"],

