Cell["\<\
That appeared pretty fast. Finding a particle should be easy, as it\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s position in the list should be close to \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964777456326857*^9, 3.964777461510858*^9}, {
  3.9647775680460176`*^9, 3.964777600110469*^9}, {3.964777814303115*^9, 
