Cell["\<\
This includes the zero distance to p2.  We need to remove p2 from the \
particle list.  p2 is particle 190, and we can remove it as follows:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.966943507211725*^9, 3.9669435929553967`*^9}, 
   3.967893926264777*^9},ExpressionUUID->"731aeab6-b325-4b09-ae74-\
a070341a08e3"],

