Cell["\<\
We can see that the loss is accelerating.  Now this is the opposite of the \
effect we saw in the series 4 runs, where the total energy grew after about a \
million steps.

The other extreme is when the particle is moving fast, but at position zero.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9703272973959637`*^9, 3.970327326580249*^9}, {
  3.970398001452675*^9, 3.970398002884604*^9}, {3.97039959791219*^9, 
