Cell["\<\
That\[CloseCurlyQuote]s a 0.22% drop in total energy. Finally, let\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s try double the speed.  It was interesting that the force \
at a79/2 was enough to essentially stop the particle.  What happens if the \
force is not enough is not enough to stop the particle?\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970328150842104*^9, 3.970328168489593*^9}, {
