Cell["\<\
That is a 0.01% increase of total energy for three steps of the velocity \
Verlet, vs. the 0.52% increase for the regular Verlet algorithm. Even at ten \
times the velocity, we get reasonable performance.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970401810215229*^9, 3.9704018694811077`*^9}, {
