Cell[TextData[{
 "That is about 38% of the inter-particle distance, which is about the range \
where ",
 StyleBox["Pdx", "Input"],
 " is circular.  Note that this displacement will move any particle to the \
edge of a lower right particle\[CloseCurlyQuote]s ",
 StyleBox["NHOPr", "Input"],
 " (at the 1/\[Pi] density). Here is the distance\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]"
}], "Text",
